        ('Illinois state and local framework', 'IDPH regulates private sewage disposal systems statewide and licenses or certifies private sewage installation and pumping contractors. IDPH also states that roughly 90 local health agencies review private sewage construction plans either under local ordinances or as agents of the Department. The county-specific requirements below come from the applicable local government or health department.')
